      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;certs-title&#34;&gt;Cisco Certified Network Associate (CCNA)&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;em class=&#34;certs-date&#34;&gt;Jul 2024&lt;/em&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Earners of Cisco CCNA - Implementing and Administering Cisco Solutions (CCNA) have demonstrated knowledge and skills related to network fundamentals, network access, IP connectivity, IP services, security fundamentals, and automation and programmability.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; alt=&#34;ccna.png&#34; src=&#34;https://jialuohu.com/images/ccna.png&#34; &gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;certs-title&#34;&gt;UCI ICS Honors Program&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;em class=&#34;certs-date&#34;&gt;Jul 2023&lt;/em&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The ICS Honors Program (ICSHP) provides an opportunity for students in any of the Bren School’s majors to carry out a research project under the direction of a Bren School faculty member. Check more details: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.ics.uci.edu/honors/&#34;&gt;https://www.ics.uci.edu/honors/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
